{
  "name": "turn-abort-before-request-status",
  "about": "中止发生在模型请求之前时的 turn_aborted 状态（src/agent/loop/AgentLoop.ts:597-614：每步开头检测到 abortSignal 已触发就以 aborted_streaming 结束；394-397 createAbortStatus 只在中止原因的文字里含 timeout / cancel / abort 时发 agent_status:turn_aborted，3910-3914，detail.reason 是原因原文）。流式输出中途的中止走 860-886 的 catch，不发这个状态，所以这里让中止落在请求之前：插件的 UserPromptSubmit hook 睡 1.5 秒（src/agent/turn/TurnRunner.ts:226-238 在 input_accepted 之后派发），收到 input_accepted 时 abort_turn，hook 结束后循环第一步就看到已中止。c1 原因 user cancelled → 发状态；c2 原因 stop now → 不发；c3 不给原因（gateway 缺省 aborted，InProcessGateway.ts:2000）→ 发。 已知不一致（未修，见报告）：Rust 照 sidecar 客户端的做法（agentLoopSidecarClient.ts:330/593，已中止的输入不发 execute，直接合成 aborted 结果，runtime/turn/live.rs 的 ExecuteResult::Aborted{terminal:None}），内置循环因此不经过 597-614 那一步，不发 turn_aborted、也不落对应的 agent_status_message 记录。",
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\":\"Abort early\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "main",
      "when": [
        "ab-"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Should not be requested."
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-ab-1",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "ab-1: stream"
      },
      "answer": [
        {
          "on": {
            "type": "input_accepted"
          },
          "ws": "abort_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "s-ab-1",
            "reason": "user cancelled"
          },
          "count": 1
        }
      ],
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-ab-2",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "ab-2: stream"
      },
      "answer": [
        {
          "on": {
            "type": "input_accepted"
          },
          "ws": "abort_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "s-ab-2",
            "reason": "stop now"
          },
          "count": 1
        }
      ],
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-ab-3",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "ab-3: stream"
      },
      "answer": [
        {
          "on": {
            "type": "input_accepted"
          },
          "ws": "abort_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "s-ab-3"
          },
          "count": 1
        }
      ],
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "sleep": 300
    },
    {
      "ws": "read_session_messages",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-ab-1"
      }
    }
  ],
  "files": {
    "home/.pilotdeck/plugins/bbx-slow/plugin.json": {
      "name": "bbx-slow",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "description": "bbx slow prompt hook",
      "hooks": {
        "UserPromptSubmit": [
          {
            "hooks": [
              {
                "type": "command",
                "command": "sleep 1.5"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
